WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.250
You learned a lot of word parts this year.

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:04.930
Port means carry.

00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:06.610
Spect means look.

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:08.290
Rupt means break.

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:09.970
Pre means before.

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:16.980
When you meet a long word, find a part you know, and the word starts to explain itself.
